<!--
	Totem Warchiefs: the Warcryer line (Warcryer, Doomcryer). Buff templates, buff shops, the
	scheme buffer and the buff books teach every chant, so the Warcryer line no longer chants:
	it plants totems and smashes them. See README "Oracles and Totem Warchiefs" and
	config/Custom/OraclesWarchiefs.ini. The retail chants are out of their class trees.

	27545-27561  Totem Warchief skills, learned from the Grand Masters like any class skill.

	TOTEMS (the PlantTotem effect, model/actor/holders/player/Totems.java): a totem NPC planted
	at the Warchief's feet. It pulses every 2 seconds to everyone within 600 and stands 30
	seconds. Monsters and the Warchief's enemies can break it. One of each kind, 3 at most: a
	4th replaces the oldest. Totems of Flames don't count: up to 3 of them on top. It falls
	when its Warchief dies, leaves or goes 2500 away. A player's totem planted without Ctrl
	only hits monsters; with Ctrl it also hits players and fake players and flags the Warchief.
	  27545 Totem of Blood        party in range: 27546 echo, part of the damage dealt comes
	                              back as HP.
	  27547 Totem of the Horde    monsters in range fighting the party turn on the totem.
	  27548 Totem of Frost-Teeth  enemies in range: 27549 hex, Speed and Atk. Spd. down.
	  27550 Totem of Ancestors    (Doomcryer) the first party member lying dead in range gets
	                              up with 30% HP; the totem is spent.
	  27558 Great Totem of the Horde-Father (Doomcryer finale): Blood, Horde and Frost-Teeth at
	                              once, within 900, for 20 seconds, can't be targeted.
	  27559 Totem of Flames       pulses every 1.67 seconds: burns up to 10 enemies within 400
	                              with 27560's magic damage (fire), the nearest first.
	27551 War Drums (stance)      P. Atk. +5%; each hit (27552 Drumbeat) takes 1 second off the
	                              reuse of every totem skill.
	27553 Shatter                 needs 3 totems up (27557 Totem Circle shows how many): each
	                              totem pulses once more and explodes on the enemies within 300.
	27554 Spirit Walk             (Doomcryer) swaps places with a totem (the targeted one, or
	                              the nearest), needs 1 totem up.
	27555 Ancestral Bond          (Doomcryer, passive) near its own totem: 27556 echo, P. Def.
	                              and M. Def. +8%.
	27561 Spirit Trance           the Warchief turns to ice for 5 seconds while its totems fight:
	                              paralyzed, P. Def. and M. Def. +300%, HP recovered every second.

	Echoes are in the triggered-buff bar and have their own abnormal types, so they stack with
	every buff. Keep custom skill ids below 32768. The client needs Skillname-e.dat /
	Skillgrp.dat rows for every id here (client/OraclesWarchiefs). The icons are those of the
	retired chants.
-->
